{"seq":12,"slug":"generative-ai","title":"生成式 AI","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-llm","chapterCount":6,"docCount":24,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai","rating":{"composite":4.2,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.58,"verdict":"consider","uScore":3.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"生成式-ai-简介\">生成式 AI 简介</h1><p>生成式人工智能是当前 AI 领域最具变革性的技术方向，它使计算机能够从数据分布中学习并创造出全新的内容——包括文本、图像、音频、视频和三维模型。从 GAN 的对抗训练到扩散模型的去噪生成，从 VAE 的隐空间建模到多模态大模型的统一生成，生成式 AI 正在重新定义人类与机器协作创造的边界。</p>\n<p>本知识库适用于具备深度学习基础知识的中高级开发者。你应该对神经网络架构、损失函数优化和概率统计有基本理解。我们将从数学原理出发，深入工程实践，帮助你建立系统的生成式 AI 知识体系。</p>\n<p>全书共分为六章，覆盖从理论基础到工程应用的完整链路。第一章<strong>生成模型基础</strong>介绍生成模型的整体图谱、概率生成模型的数学框架、隐空间的几何结构以及生成质量的评估指标，为后续各类生成模型的学习奠定理论基础。第二章<strong>扩散模型</strong>深入当前最主流的生成范式，涵盖扩散过程的数学推导、Stable Diffusion 架构解析、条件引导机制以及推理加速技术。第三章<strong>GAN 与 VAE</strong>系统讲解生成对抗网络和变分自编码器的原理与变体，并拓展到标准化流等可逆生成模型。第四章<strong>文本到图像</strong>聚焦图像生成的核心技术栈，包括文图架构设计、ControlNet 等精确控制方法、图像编辑技术和完整的生成管线搭建。第五章<strong>多模态生成</strong>拓展到视频、音频和三维模型的生成，探讨跨模态统一生成的前沿方向。第六章<strong>AIGC 应用</strong>关注生成式 AI 的工程落地，涉及创意设计、代码生成、内容生产管线以及版权伦理等关键议题。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径为按章节顺序阅读。第一章为理论基础，不可跳过。如果你已熟悉 GAN 和 VAE，可以从第二章扩散模型开始。对于关注工程实践的读者，可在完成前两章后直接跳转到第四章和第六章。每篇文档都配有架构图、对比表和代码示例，建议结合 PyTorch 和 Diffusers 库进行动手实验。</p>\n<p><strong>本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的边界</strong>：本 hub 是生成式 AI 的全景图，但三个主题的深水区由兄弟 hub 承接。<a href=\"../diffusion-models/\">扩散模型</a>完整覆盖扩散范式的数学推导与模型谱系——本 hub 第二章只取其工程主线；<a href=\"../diffusion-sampling-solvers/\">扩散采样与求解器</a>专讲 DDIM、DPM-Solver、蒸馏加速等采样侧算法，本 hub 在推理加速处只做使用者视角的概览；<a href=\"../multimodal-ai/\">多模态 AI</a>覆盖多模态的理解侧（对齐、融合、视觉问答），本 hub 聚焦生成侧（文生图/视频/音频/3D）。按此分工跳转即可，不必在本 hub 内找这些专题的全量细节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><p>以下兄弟 hub 与本 hub 互补，按需深入：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../diffusion-models/\">扩散模型</a>：扩散生成范式的训练目标、架构与变体全集，是本 hub 第二章的理论纵深。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../diffusion-sampling-solvers/\">扩散采样与求解器</a>：把「训练好的扩散模型」变成「可用的出图系统」的采样算法专题，衔接本 hub 的推理加速文档。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../multimodal-ai/\">多模态 AI</a>：多模态理解与统一架构（CLIP 类对齐、VLM、通才模型），与本 hub 的「多模态生成」互为另一半。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"generative-foundations","title":"生成模型基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/generative-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"generative-model-landscape","title":"生成模型全景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/generative-foundations/generative-model-landscape"},{"seq":2,"slug":"probabilistic-generative-models","title":"概率生成模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/generative-foundations/probabilistic-generative-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"latent-space","title":"隐空间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/generative-foundations/latent-space"},{"seq":4,"slug":"evaluation-metrics","title":"生成质量评估指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/generative-foundations/evaluation-metrics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"diffusion-models","title":"扩散模型","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/diffusion-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"diffusion-theory","title":"扩散过程的数学理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/diffusion-models/diffusion-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stable-diffusion","title":"Stable Diffusion 架构解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/diffusion-models/stable-diffusion"},{"seq":3,"slug":"conditioning-guidance","title":"条件引导机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/diffusion-models/conditioning-guidance"},{"seq":4,"slug":"diffusion-acceleration","title":"扩散模型加速","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/diffusion-models/diffusion-acceleration"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"gan-and-vae","title":"GAN 与 VAE","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/gan-and-vae","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gan-fundamentals","title":"GAN 基础原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/gan-and-vae/gan-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"gan-variants","title":"GAN 变体与演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/gan-and-vae/gan-variants"},{"seq":3,"slug":"vae-fundamentals","title":"VAE 基础原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/gan-and-vae/vae-fundamentals"},{"seq":4,"slug":"flow-models","title":"标准化流模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/gan-and-vae/flow-models"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"text-to-image","title":"文本到图像","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/text-to-image","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"text-image-architecture","title":"文图架构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/text-to-image/text-image-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"controlnet-and-adapters","title":"ControlNet 与适配器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/text-to-image/controlnet-and-adapters"},{"seq":3,"slug":"image-editing","title":"图像编辑技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/text-to-image/image-editing"},{"seq":4,"slug":"image-generation-pipeline","title":"图像生成管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/text-to-image/image-generation-pipeline"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"multimodal-generation","title":"多模态生成","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/multimodal-generation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"text-to-video","title":"文本到视频生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/multimodal-generation/text-to-video"},{"seq":2,"slug":"text-to-audio","title":"文本到音频生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/multimodal-generation/text-to-audio"},{"seq":3,"slug":"text-to-3d","title":"文本到三维生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/multimodal-generation/text-to-3d"},{"seq":4,"slug":"cross-modal-generation","title":"跨模态统一生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/multimodal-generation/cross-modal-generation"}]},{"seq":6,"slug":"aigc-applications","title":"AIGC 应用","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/aigc-applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"creative-ai","title":"创意 AI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/aigc-applications/creative-ai"},{"seq":2,"slug":"code-generation","title":"代码生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/aigc-applications/code-generation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"content-pipeline","title